    calls detectVideoMode; if no supported adapter is found, prints 'Ultima I requires a Color Graphics Adapter...' and exit(1)s. Otherwise calls probeMemoryForVideoMode with a flag for whether EGA mode was detected (and no -C override), or 0 otherwise.
